      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GENOVESE (8) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (20.39) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Has claims if he runs up to expectations. RUBY SHELBY (7) turned in a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 450m behind Primal Boost (25.72) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Deserves plenty of respect. CONOR FIRE (4) was out of the placings last time when fifth at Q Straight (19.44) but scored three back at Capalaba (19.90). The form out of his last race has been franked. Should be about the mark. MANILA SUN (1) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
